    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Never Fall</strong>, a relaxing and immersive experience where there\u2019s no rush, no pressure\u2014just you and the journey upward. Take control of a ball and challenge yourself to reach new heights, but remember: this isn't about winning or losing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to test your unwind, this game is here to provide a stress-free, chill adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf88 <strong>No pressure, just fun</strong> \u2013 Move, jump, and climb your way up, enjoying the process without worrying about failure.<br>\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Relaxing experience</strong> \u2013 Soft visuals and smoothing sounds create a peaceful, meditative journey. <br>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Reach new heights</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself or take it slow\u2014there\u2019s no right or wrong way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 <strong>Support the Next Big Project!</strong><br>This game is more than just a fun and relaxing experience\u2014it's also a donation to help fund an ambitious new <strong>simulator game</strong> in development. By playing and supporting this game, you're directly contributing to the creation of an even bigger and more immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being part of this journey! Your support means everything. \ud83d\ude4c\u2728</p>",
